<title>USA: Mecon names chief executive.</title>
<headline>Mecon names chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAMON, Calif. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MECON Inc said Les Schmidt was named chief executive officer, a role he will serve in addition to his post as president.</p>
<p>It said Vasu Devan, who previously served as chairman and chief executive officer, will now serve as chairman.</p>
